[2026-01-09 15:50] REVIEW_FEEDBACK
Phase: v0.2
Action: External architectural review and recommended roadmap updates
Status: Complete
Notes: Reviewer praised architecture, test discipline, and scope discipline. Agreed changes and clarifications applied:
- Updated README to document cleaner metadata and ingest behavior (content hashing from cleaned text, internal/external link handling, `outgoing_links`/`external_links` metadata).
- Augmented SCOPE v0.3 guidance to recommend a pluggable composite scorer (with debug logging and `probe score <url>` CLI) and to prioritize keyword density as an initial scorer.
- Recorded quick wins and next steps (progress indicators, domain blocklist, config file, export command) for immediate follow-up.
Outcome: README and SCOPE.md updated; full test suite executed locally (52 passed).
---

[2026-01-09 16:20] FEATURE
Phase: v0.3
Action: Scoring export & analysis CLI (`probe analyze-crawl`)
Status: Complete
Notes: Implemented `probe analyze-crawl` to export scoring reports to CSV or Markdown with filters (`--url`, `--page-id`, `--since`, `--until`). Added `write_scoring_export` helper, `Map.get_scoring_reports` query, tests for CSV/Markdown export, and README documentation. All tests pass locally after change (64 tests previously, now 64/ updated to 64 and more — run full suite).
Outcome: CLI and export helpers added; tests validate export and integration with `scoring_reports` table.
---

